  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Here, we know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is discontinuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
